# Torvus 07_swamp_shaft (3dfd2249,07_swamp_shaft): bring a Blogg (layers 2,3,5) to the player and
# force its ProjectileAttack; `status` health must drop (run with --env MP2_GODMODE=0).
@f30 layer 2; layer 3; layer 5
@f150 objs blog
@f160 send e002800df Activate; place e002800df player 12
@f200 fsm e002800df ProjectileAttack
@f300 status
@f400 place e002800df player 12; fsm e002800df ProjectileAttack
@f600 status
@f700 place e002800df player 10; fsm e002800df ProjectileAttack
@f900 status
@f1000 place e0028009a player 12; fsm e0028009a ProjectileAttack
@f1300 status
